			"local_notes": "Lore: Recognising the signs of Chaos corruption, forbidden cults, and heretical doctrine before it is too late — or, for an Inquisitor, knowing enough heresy to hunt it. Central to Eisenhorn and the Ravenor trilogy.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Hidden Lore (B199).",
