			"local_notes": "Lore: Scholarly (not psychic) knowledge of the Immaterium: what the Astronomican is, why Navigators need a Geller field, what a warp storm does to a fleet. This is book-learning available to non-psykers; actual perception of the warp is Psyniscience or a psychic power.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Hidden Lore (B199).",
