			"local_notes": "Lore: The rigorous, empirical study of xenos biology, technology and society — Explorator and Ordo Xenos work, not folk rumour (that's Hidden Lore (Xenos)). No default, as Basic Set's Expert Skill never has one: this is specialist training only.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Expert Skill (B193), IQ/Hard as in the Basic Set library entry for Xenology.",
