			"local_notes": "Lore: Breaking down a heretic's door, a xenos hab-block hatch, or a barricaded cell — standard fieldcraft for Arbites, Militarum Tempestus breach teams and Inquisitorial storm squads alike.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Forced Entry (B196), no default per the Basic Set entry.",
